<title>FRANCE: French unemployment falls slightly in July - paper.</title>
<headline>French unemployment falls slightly in July - paper.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>French unemployment fell slightly in July, the Liberation daily reported on Friday.</p>
<p>The newspaper's report, quoting reliable sources, did not give a figure.</p>
<p>July unemployment is due to be released at 0645 GMT.</p>
<p>In June, seasonally adjusted unemployment rose by 22,800 people, or 0.7 percent, to 3,065,000 from 3,042,800 in May, the Labour Ministry said last month.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
